window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Her best friend is gone. Her magic is growing.<br> And the Winter Prince who ruined her life might be her only way to survive it.<br> </b><br> Sapphire Hayes didn’t come to the fae realm to fall in love with a prince—or to become a fugitive from his court.<br> <br> But after surviving the Winter Trials, nothing is the same.<br> <br> Riven killed his own knights to protect her.<br> <br> And Sapphire made a dangerous deal that binds her fate to his: brew a forbidden potion to save his father’s mind… or lose her only chance of getting home.<br> <br> Then Zoey is taken by a dark-winged monster. Saving her means following a star map deep into the Wandering Wilds—a realm of ancient creatures, cosmic magic, and secrets buried by the courts for centuries. With Riven at her side. Every step of the way.<br> <br> Riven is cold, calculating, and devastatingly beautiful. He’s the only one who believes in Sapphire’s instinctive, untamed magic. The way she feels ingredients. The way her potions hum with power. The way her kisses… change everything.<br> <br> But Sapphire is keeping secrets, too.<br> Her air magic. Her thirst for blood. Her true nature.<br> <br> And in the fae realm, secrets might just get you killed.<br> <br> <b>Perfect for fans of ACOTAR, The Cruel Prince, and Throne of Glass, Fallen Star is the breathtaking second installment in the Fae Bound series—where every deal comes with a price, and every heartbeat might be your last.</b></p>"; 
